    "en": "The Tetherless World Constellation (TWC) at Rensselaer Polytechnic Institute (RPI) maintains Linked Open Government Data (LOGD), an RDF version of the datasets published by package:data-gov and other government-related sources.\r\n\r\nLOGD replaces the old TWC Data-gov Corpus published in May 2010."
